{"t": 1794106689.8835175, "kind": "call", "tool": "slack_post_message", "args": {"channel_id": "C07INCID003", "text": "reports-api 502 \u2014 root cause found. CloudWatch `/ecs/reports-api` (eu-west-1) shows: `ERROR export failed: ValueError: dict contains fields not in fieldnames: 'currency'`, logged with `upstream ledger 2026.11 added currency to every row`. `reports/export.py` declared only `id, amount` in its csv.DictWriter, so every export row now raises and the API returns 502.\n\nFix: added `currency` to the export fieldnames in reports/export.py; verified exports work for new rows (id, amount, currency) and legacy rows without currency. Needs a reports-api redeploy to clear the 502."}, "ok": true}
